| [leaf-requirements-quality-theory-roadmap-finding] | 候选发现台账，不直接作为 final finding | discussion / conclusion / roadmap action | 否 | 支撑 candidate finding、risk 或 boundary anchor | final research finding 必须由研究者裁决。 |

