    │   │   └── form: descriptive / formula
    │   └── Entity-fact
    │       └── derived relation: Entity characterized by Factor
    ├── Activity-related concepts
    │   ├── Agent
    │   │   └── presence/count: reported in 14/57
    │   ├── Activity
    │   │   ├── presence/count: reported in 40/57
